    <string name="about_app_title">FareLug</string>
    <string name="about_version">Version 1.0</string>
    <string name="about_description">Welcome to <b>FareLug</b>, your smart travel companion for estimating excess baggage fees!\n\nFareLug is a mobile application designed to help travellers calculate their estimated excess baggage charges before arriving at the airport. Users can enter their luggage weight, select an airline, and check the estimated additional fees based on the airline\'s baggage allowance and fee rates.\n\nWith FareLug, travellers can plan their luggage more effectively, manage their travel expenses, and avoid unexpected baggage charges. Our application makes excess baggage fee estimation simple, convenient, and accessible anytime, anywhere.\n\n<b>Travel Smart. Pack Smart. Fly with FareLug!</b></string>
